<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-br">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <title>Verifique seu E-mail - Portal Lab Kids</title>
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <link rel="manifest" href="/manifest.json">
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#4f46e5">
  <link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="512x512" href="/img/robot-icon-512.png">
  <link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="192x192" href="/img/robot-icon-192.png">
  <link rel="shortcut icon" href="/favicon.ico">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css?v=3">
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fredoka:wght@400;600&family=Outfit:wght@400;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    body {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--bg-color) 0%, #d4e4f7 100%);
      font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif;
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 20px;
    }
    .verify-card {
      background: #ffffff;
      border-radius: 20px;
      padding: 40px;
      box-shadow: 0 15px 35px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
      max-width: 480px;
      width: 100%;
      text-align: center;
      border: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.06);
    }
    .verify-icon {
      font-size: 50px;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
      display: inline-block;
      animation: float 3s ease-in-out infinite;
    }
    @keyframes float {
      0%, 100% { transform: translateY(0); }
      50% { transform: translateY(-8px); }
    }
    h1 {
      font-family: 'Fredoka', sans-serif;
      color: #1e1b4b;
      margin: 0 0 10px 0;
      font-size: 1.8rem;
    }
    p {
      color: #64748b;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      line-height: 1.5;
      margin-bottom: 25px;
    }
    .email-highlight {
      color: #4f46e5;
      font-weight: 700;
      background: #eff6ff;
      padding: 3px 8px;
      border-radius: 6px;
      display: inline-block;
      word-break: break-all;
    }
    .code-input {
      width: 100%;
      font-size: 2rem;
      letter-spacing: 12px;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 15px;
      border: 2px solid #cbd5e1;
      border-radius: 12px;
      font-weight: 800;
      font-family: monospace;
      color: #1e293b;
      box-sizing: border-box;
      transition: all 0.3s;
      background: #f8fafc;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }
    .code-input:focus {
      border-color: #4f46e5;
      outline: none;
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px rgba(79, 70, 229, 0.15);
      background: #ffffff;
    }
    .btn-submit {
      width: 100%;
      padding: 16px;
      background: #4f46e5;
      color: white;
      border: none;
      border-radius: 12px;
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: 0.3s;
      font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif;
    }
    .btn-submit:hover {
      background: #4338ca;
      transform: translateY(-2px);
      box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(79, 70, 229, 0.4);
    }
    .error {
      background: #ffe5e5;
      color: #d63031;
      padding: 12px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
    }
    .success {
      background: #e5ffe5;
      color: #27ae60;
      padding: 12px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
    }
    .resend-box {
      margin-top: 25px;
      padding-top: 20px;
      border-top: 1px solid #f1f5f9;
      font-size: 0.88rem;
      color: #64748b;
    }
    .resend-link {
      color: #4f46e5;
      font-weight: 700;
      text-decoration: none;
      cursor: pointer;
    }
    .resend-link:hover {
      text-decoration: underline;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <div class="verify-card">
    <div class="verify-icon">📬</div>
    <h1>Verifique seu E-mail</h1>
    <p>
      Enviamos um código de segurança de 6 dígitos para:<br>
      <span class="email-highlight"><%= email %></span>
    </p>

    <% if (error) { %>
      <div class="error"><%= error %></div>
    <% } %>
    <% if (typeof success !== 'undefined' && success) { %>
      <div class="success"><%= success %></div>
    <% } %>

    <form action="/professor/verificar" method="POST">
      <input type="hidden" name="email" value="<%= email %>">
      <input 
        type="text" 
        name="code" 
        class="code-input" 
        placeholder="000000" 
        maxlength="6" 
        pattern="[0-9]{6}" 
        inputmode="numeric" 
        autocomplete="one-time-code" 
        required 
        autofocus
      >
      <button type="submit" class="btn-submit">Confirmar e Ativar Conta 🚀</button>
    </form>

    <div class="resend-box">
      <p style="margin: 0 0 10px 0;">Não recebeu o e-mail? Verifique também a pasta de <strong>Spam</strong>.</p>
      <form action="/professor/reenviar-codigo" method="POST" style="display: inline;">
        <input type="hidden" name="email" value="<%= email %>">
        <button type="submit" style="background: none; border: none; color: #4f46e5; font-weight: 700; cursor: pointer; font-size: 0.9rem; font-family: inherit; text-decoration: underline;">
          🔄 Reenviar Código por E-mail
        </button>
      </form>
      <div style="margin-top: 15px;">
        <a href="/professor/login?cadastro=1" style="color: #94a3b8; text-decoration: none; font-size: 0.85rem;">
          ⬅ Informou o e-mail errado? Corrigir cadastro
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

</body>
</html>
